00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:19.378
Happy Friday.

00:01:19.378 --> 00:01:20.747
Guys, New York's
stay-at-home order

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:22.247
was scheduled to end today,

00:01:22.247 --> 00:01:25.818
but Governor Cuomo just
extended it until June 13th.

00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:27.053
For New Yorkers, it felt like

00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:28.521
when a Zoom meeting is
about to end

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:30.089
and then,
someone asks a question.

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:32.391
"Oh, well, I --"

00:01:32.391 --> 00:01:33.626
[ Whispering ]
We're almost --

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.528
We're almost there.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.063
That's right,
New York's stay-at-home order

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:39.032
has been extended
until June 13th.

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:41.034
Asked why June 13th, Cuomo said,

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:42.936
"'Cause there's no way
we could stop crowds

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:46.739
from celebrating Flag Day
on June 14th."

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:48.641
Mayor de Blasio said
that New York City beaches

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:51.143
are just not ready to open.

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:53.012
But, if you wanna experience
New York City beaches,

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:55.481
just throw your towel
over some shattered beer bottles

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:57.083
and old cigarette butts

00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:58.184
and then,
let a bunch of pigeons

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:01.020
come over and eat your food.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.956
I read that McCarran Airport
in Las Vegas

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.358
now has vending machines
with face masks

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:09.161
and hand sanitizer
and other PPE products.

00:02:09.161 --> 00:02:10.830
It'll be just like those
Best Buy vending machines,

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.665
except people will use these.

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:16.536
[ New York accent ]
Uh, honey,
before we get on the flight,

00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:21.907
do you have any monster cables
to go in the HDMI port?

00:02:21.907 --> 00:02:24.209
What?!
Honey, g-give me

00:02:24.209 --> 00:02:27.312
6,000 quarters.

00:02:27.312 --> 00:02:28.948
Some TV news --
CBS announced

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:32.252
