are desperate for content

00:02:34.386 --> 00:02:35.421
'cause, right after that,

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:40.260
CBS is airing
a "Grease 2" sing-along.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.861
I've never seen "Grease 2."

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:43.062
-No way.

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:45.198
-Never seen it.

00:02:45.198 --> 00:02:46.766
-It's not "Grease" one.

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:48.334
-Nope.
I just refuse to --

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:50.770
I just had so much fun
with "Grease."

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.439
Leave it at that.
-Some people love "Grease 2."

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:55.507
-Some people love
"Grease 2," yeah, sure.

00:02:55.507 --> 00:02:57.409
Some people like
"Godfather III."

00:02:57.409 --> 00:02:58.411
-True.
-Yeah.

00:02:58.411 --> 00:03:00.045
-Some do.

00:03:00.045 --> 00:03:01.814
-I saw that Disney
Theatrical Productions

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:04.617
announced that "Frozen"
will not reopen on Broadway

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:06.952
after the pandemic.

00:03:06.952 --> 00:03:08.955
That's probably a good call.
After months of quarantine,

00:03:08.955 --> 00:03:12.391
