"Ah, let it go. Let it go."

00:03:12.391 --> 00:03:13.626
I loved "Frozen"!

00:03:13.626 --> 00:03:15.562
"Hygge"!
-Yeah.

00:03:15.562 --> 00:03:17.196
-Agh!

00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:19.031
