version of "Frozen," it's great.

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:31.777
But, there's a song on there
called "Hygge"

00:03:31.777 --> 00:03:34.313
that's really funny.

00:03:34.313 --> 00:03:37.783
So, maybe we can get them
to do that for, I don't know.

00:03:37.783 --> 00:03:40.052
Anyway, we loved it.

00:03:40.052 --> 00:03:41.954
Check this out --
Netflix is making a new movie

00:03:41.954 --> 00:03:45.791
