00:05:09.141 --> 00:05:10.242
I'm in.

00:05:10.242 --> 00:05:12.678
Pa-pa-pa-pa-pa-pa-pants!

00:05:12.678 --> 00:05:14.480
Listen to this --
I read that grocery stores

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:17.516
