00:08:27.873 --> 00:08:29.842
Thank you guys
for really helping me out.

00:08:29.842 --> 00:08:31.210
Now, it's time to go play now.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:33.078
Thank you so much.

00:08:33.078 --> 00:08:34.480
Hey, guys, we have
a great show tonight.

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:36.081
Dwayne "The Rock" Johnson is

00:08:36.081 --> 00:08:37.082
