00:08:45.791 --> 00:08:47.493
He's got a lot to talk about.

00:08:47.493 --> 00:08:49.861
And also, music is
The Head and the Heart.

00:08:49.861 --> 00:08:50.863
Just a talented group.

00:08:50.863 --> 00:08:51.897
I love those guys.

00:08:51.897 --> 00:08:53.732
Out of Seattle, I believe.

00:08:53.732 --> 00:08:56.168
Guys, today we have
something to talk about --

00:08:56.168 --> 00:08:59.438
walgreens.com/rednoseday.

00:08:59.438 --> 00:09:01.106
I wrote this.

00:09:01.106 --> 00:09:02.608
I was thinking
about maybe faking

00:09:02.608 --> 00:09:06.745
like one of the girls drew it,
but they just didn't feel --

00:09:06.745 --> 00:09:10.382
They drew wish.org for Dwayne

00:09:10.382 --> 00:09:12.184
and I said, "Can't you just
put some color into it?"

00:09:12.184 --> 00:09:13.386
'Cause it was just pencil.

00:09:13.386 --> 00:09:14.586
And so -- I don't know
if you could see --

00:09:14.586 --> 00:09:17.189
Winnie put blue pencil
over the other pencil.

00:09:17.189 --> 00:09:18.390
It's still pencil.

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:19.758
-It's Friday.
-I understand,

00:09:19.758 --> 00:09:20.759
but, still, it's like --

00:09:20.759 --> 00:09:22.794
Anyways, I drew this --

00:09:22.794 --> 00:09:25.697
walgreens.com/rednoseday.

00:09:25.697 --> 00:09:29.568
-Looks like Winnie's.
-It does, yeah, but I -- well.

00:09:29.568 --> 00:09:32.671
[ Laughing ] She learns
from the best, you know?

00:09:32.671 --> 00:09:35.207
Red Nose Day.
You know I love Red Nose Day.

00:09:35.207 --> 00:09:38.210
Walgreens is continuing
its tradition by,

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:40.846
if you make the purchase,
you also get a digital red nose.

00:09:40.846 --> 00:09:42.214
So, do that.

00:09:42.214 --> 00:09:45.584
